  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Queen Rearing: Save a Greek Bee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bees are vital to our health and the environment. 71/100 of plants which are responsible for 90% of the global food supply rely upon the bee-pollinators. Queen Rearing Program completely transforms beekeeping in Greece by optimizing the regional genetic material to develop more resilient and productive bee colonies, while youth in the Greek provinces secure a career. The program secures our ecosystem&apos;s protection but also its empowerment and resistance towards the challenging climate conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
